source: crates/emela-types/tests/signature.rs
expression: "run(r#\"\nenum Shape {\n  Circle(radius: Float)\n  Rect(Float, Float)\n  Empty\n}\nenum Tree[A] {\n  Leaf\n  Node(Tree[A], A, Tree[A])\n}\n\"#)"
---
Circle: fn(Float) -> Shape  (radius:)
Rect: fn(Float, Float) -> Shape  (_, _)
